OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CSaturday:FSaturday morning will be     
OL,6,Fcloudy, breezy and wet with outbreaks  
OL,7,Fof rain, some heavy. The rain should   
OL,8,Fease from the west during the          
OL,9,Fafternoon though, allowing skies to    
OL,10,Fbrighten later.                        
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday  
OL,13,Fwill be much brighter, though a few    
OL,14,Fshowers are possible. Monday looks     
OL,15,Fcloudier, with some wet and windy      
OL,16,Fweather developing into Tuesday.       
OL,17,FTurning milder at the same time.       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
